<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on Taiwan semiconductor stocks.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Taiwan semiconductor stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Monday it proposed to issue 20 million American-style call warrants on a basket of Taiwan semiconductor stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p>  United Microelectronics Corp		 1 share</p>
<p>  Siliconware Precision			  1 share</p>
<p>  Taiwan Seminconductor Manufacuring Corp  1 share</p>
<p>  Mosel Vitelic Inc				1 share</p>
<p>One warrant equivalent to one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$6.81	PREMIUM	 14.83 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$1.01	GEARING	 6.74X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  15.AUG.97    PAYDATE	 TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG   MIN EXER LOT  1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    US$6.81	LISTING DATE  TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p> NOTE    CO-LEAD MANAGED BY CAPITAL SECURITIES (HONG KONG) LTD</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
